Here at helm/charts/templates  you find the kubernetes deployment and service yml files
for the register deploy there is an variable called image: {{ .Values.appimage }} we need to give this variable while running the 
helm command

helm list
helm install my-release helm/charts --set appimage=akhilmylaram/register

helm uninstall my-release

sh "helm upgrade --install --force vprofile-stack helm/vprofilecharts --set appimage=${registry}:V${BUILD_NUMBER} --namespace prod"

